{"seq":1,"slug":"learning-to-rank","title":"学习排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank","wordCount":978,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"学习排序\">学习排序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>学习排序（Learning to Rank, LTR）是利用机器学习方法自动学习文档排序函数的技术，是搜索引擎排序的核心范式。与手工调参的排序规则不同，LTR 从大规模标注数据中学习特征与相关性之间的复杂映射关系，能够处理数百个排序特征的非线性组合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 学习排序管线&#10;        DATA[标注数据] --&gt; FE[特征工程]&#10;        FE --&gt; TRAIN[模型训练]&#10;        TRAIN --&gt; EVAL[离线评估]&#10;        EVAL --&gt; DEPLOY[在线部署]&#10;        DEPLOY --&gt; LOG[日志收集]&#10;        LOG --&gt; DATA&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 三大范式&#10;        PW[Pointwise]&#10;        PAIR[Pairwise]&#10;        LIST[Listwise]&#10;    end&#10;    TRAIN --&gt; PW&#10;    TRAIN --&gt; PAIR&#10;    TRAIN --&gt; LIST\">graph TB\n    subgraph 学习排序管线\n        DATA[标注数据] --&gt; FE[特征工程]\n        FE --&gt; TRAIN[模型训练]\n        TRAIN --&gt; EVAL[离线评估]\n        EVAL --&gt; DEPLOY[在线部署]\n        DEPLOY --&gt; LOG[日志收集]\n        LOG --&gt; DATA\n    end\n    subgraph 三大范式\n        PW[Pointwise]\n        PAIR[Pairwise]\n        LIST[Listwise]\n    end\n    TRAIN --&gt; PW\n    TRAIN --&gt; PAIR\n    TRAIN --&gt; LIST</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>训练单元</th>\n<th>损失函数</th>\n<th>代表模型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pointwise</td>\n<td>单文档</td>\n<td>回归/分类损失</td>\n<td>PRank, OC SVM</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>忽略文档间关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pairwise</td>\n<td>文档对</td>\n<td>偏序损失</td>\n<td>RankSVM, RankNet, LambdaMART</td>\n<td>直接优化偏序</td>\n<td>对 top 位置不够敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listwise</td>\n<td>文档列表</td>\n<td>列表级损失</td>\n<td>ListNet, LambdaRank</td>\n<td>直接优化排序指标</td>\n<td>训练复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"排序特征工程\">排序特征工程</h2><p>排序特征是 LTR 模型的输入，直接决定了模型的表达能力上界。排序特征通常分为查询特征、文档特征和查询-文档交互特征三类。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RankingFeatures {&#10;  queryFeatures: QueryFeatures;&#10;  docFeatures: DocFeatures;&#10;  interactionFeatures: InteractionFeatures;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface QueryFeatures {&#10;  queryLength: number;&#10;  queryTermCount: number;&#10;  avgIDF: number;&#10;  queryEntropy: number;&#10;  isNavigational: boolean;&#10;  queryEmbedding: Float32Array;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DocFeatures {&#10;  docLength: number;&#10;  pageRank: number;&#10;  clickCount: number;&#10;  freshness: number;&#10;  domainAuthority: number;&#10;  titleLength: number;&#10;  urlDepth: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface InteractionFeatures {&#10;  bm25Score: number;&#10;  tfidfCosine: number;&#10;  titleBM25: number;&#10;  queryTermCoverage: number;&#10;  exactMatchCount: number;&#10;  proximityScore: number;&#10;  embedSimilarity: number;&#10;  queryTermInTitle: boolean;&#10;  queryTermInUrl: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function extractFeatures(query: string, doc: Document, index: InvertedIndex): RankingFeatures {&#10;  const queryTokens = tokenize(query);&#10;  const docTokens = tokenize(doc.content);&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    queryFeatures: {&#10;      queryLength: query.length,&#10;      queryTermCount: queryTokens.length,&#10;      avgIDF: queryTokens.reduce((s, t) =&gt; s + getIDF(t, index), 0) / queryTokens.length,&#10;      queryEntropy: calculateEntropy(queryTokens, index),&#10;      isNavigational: detectNavigationalIntent(query),&#10;      queryEmbedding: new Float32Array(768),&#10;    },&#10;    docFeatures: {&#10;      docLength: docTokens.length,&#10;      pageRank: doc.pageRank,&#10;      clickCount: doc.clickStats.total,&#10;      freshness: Date.now() - doc.lastModified,&#10;      domainAuthority: doc.domainAuthority,&#10;      titleLength: doc.title.length,&#10;      urlDepth: doc.url.split(&#39;/&#39;).length - 3,&#10;    },&#10;    interactionFeatures: {&#10;      bm25Score: calculateBM25(queryTokens, docTokens, index),&#10;      tfidfCosine: calculateTFIDFCosine(queryTokens, docTokens, index),&#10;      titleBM25: calculateBM25(queryTokens, tokenize(doc.title), index),&#10;      queryTermCoverage: queryTokens.filter((t) =&gt; docTokens.includes(t)).length / queryTokens.length,&#10;      exactMatchCount: countExactMatches(query, doc.content),&#10;      proximityScore: calculateProximity(queryTokens, docTokens),&#10;      embedSimilarity: cosineSim(query, doc.content),&#10;      queryTermInTitle: queryTokens.some((t) =&gt; doc.title.includes(t)),&#10;      queryTermInUrl: queryTokens.some((t) =&gt; doc.url.includes(t)),&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RankingFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DocFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  interactionFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InteractionFeatures</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><s