<span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doc.url.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">includes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>特征工程是 LTR 中最耗时但最有价值的环节。经验表明，BM25 分数、点击率、PageRank 和嵌入相似度是最重要的四类特征。在实际系统中，排序特征数量通常在 200-1000 之间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lambdamart-与梯度提升排序\">LambdaMART 与梯度提升排序</h2><p>LambdaMART 是工业界最广泛使用的 LTR 模型，它结合了 LambdaRank 的梯度计算方法和 MART（Multiple Additive Regression Trees，即 GBDT）的集成学习框架。</p>\n<p>LambdaMART 的核心创新是 Lambda 梯度：它不直接优化不可微的排序指标（如 NDCG），而是定义了一个隐式的梯度函数 λ，使得每棵树的分裂方向都朝着改善排序指标的方向进行。NDCG 这类指标的精确定义与统计检验方法见<a href=\"../search-evaluation/offline-metrics\">离线评估指标</a>——训练目标的定义必须与评估口径严格一致，否则离线提升无法兑现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LambdaMARTConfig {&#10;  numTrees: number;&#10;  maxDepth: number;&#10;  learningRate: number;&#10;  minDataInLeaf: number;&#10;  numLeaves: number;&#10;  metric: &#39;ndcg&#39; | &#39;map&#39; | &#39;mrr&#39;;&#10;  ndcgTruncation: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface LambdaGradient {&#10;  docIdx: number;&#10;  gradient: number;&#10;  hessian: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computeLambdaGradients(scores: number[], labels: number[], config: LambdaMARTConfig): LambdaGradient[] {&#10;  const gradients: LambdaGradient[] = scores.map((_, i) =&gt; ({&#10;    docIdx: i,&#10;    gradient: 0,&#10;    hessian: 0,&#10;  }));&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; scores.length; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = i + 1; j &lt; scores.length; j++) {&#10;      if (labels[i] === labels[j]) continue;&#10;&#10;      const highIdx = labels[i] &gt; labels[j] ? i : j;&#10;      const lowIdx = labels[i] &gt; labels[j] ? j : i;&#10;&#10;      const scoreDiff = scores[highIdx] - scores[lowIdx];&#10;      const rho = 1 / (1 + Math.exp(scoreDiff));&#10;&#10;      const deltaNDCG = computeDeltaNDCG(highIdx, lowIdx, labels, scores, config.ndcgTruncation);&#10;      const lambda = Math.abs(deltaNDCG) * rho;&#10;&#10;      gradients[highIdx].gradient += lambda;&#10;      gradients[lowIdx].gradient -= lambda;&#10;      gradients[highIdx].hessian += lambda * (1 - rho);&#10;      gradients[lowIdx].hessian += lambda * (1 - rho);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return gradients;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LambdaMARTConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  numTrees</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxDepth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  learningRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  minDataInLeaf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><sp